message: If you use Strandivo in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Strandivo
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source plasmid editor: plasmid maps and sequence editing, primers,
  digests and cloning simulation, and sequence verification with Sanger and
  whole-plasmid reads.
